Find the Longest Word in a Sentence

Exercise:
Given a sentence, find the longest word.

Example:

Input: "I love programming"

Output: "programming"


Solution:


let str = "I love programming";
let words = str.split(" ");
let count = 0;

for (let i = 0; i < words.length; i++) {
  if (words[i].length > count) {
    count = words[i].length;
  }
}

console.log(count);
